		{
			can_repeat: true
			dependencies: ["369BA1002418F097"]
			description: [
				"Sneak-right-click a working GT machine with this magic bottle to speed up its work"
				"Of course, using such a powerful item consumes your hunger, and the speed-up grows weaker as the machine tier rises"
				"Mechanics:"
				"Each use consumes 1 charge; charges regenerate at 1 per second, and the maximum stored charges is 20"
				"Machine tiers from steam machines to HV machines are 0-3; above HV it has no effect"
				"When a machine recipe takes longer than 20 seconds, the time is reduced by (4 - machine tier) x 2 seconds"
				"When a machine recipe takes longer than 10 seconds, the time is reduced by (4 - machine tier) seconds"
				"When a machine recipe takes longer than 2 seconds, the time is reduced by (4 - machine tier) x 0.5 seconds"
				"The Primitive Blast Furnace is a flat 5 second reduction"
			]
